      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1075219364,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> We might want to disable the CI job by renaming \"ABI Check\" to \".ABI Check\" for now.\n\nThat's a bit cleaner, as it leaves the infrastructure in place, it just temporarily prevents it from being switched on.\n\n> Guy, do you want to do that in this MR or should we create a separate one?\n\nGiven the lack of a \"pitch this merge request into a black hole\" option in GitLab, we might as well repurpose this one.  That'd be a change to .gitlab-ci.yml, right?",
